{"4998160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Land", "steam_appid": 4998160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as an explorer who arrives on a mysterious island, surviving and exploring in a land teeming with wild beasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes, Play games with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various survival gear, weapons, and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame and feed animals, ride pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful building system allows you to create your own unique world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant various crops to develop agriculture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing: Catch various fish in the ocean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique ecosystem with a variety of wild beasts waiting to be discovered and hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and realistic dynamic weather provides an immersive experience.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as an explorer who arrives on a mysterious island, surviving and exploring in a land teeming with wild beasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes, Play games with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft various survival gear, weapons, and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame and feed animals, ride pets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful building system allows you to create your own unique world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant various crops to d